cess. I know lots of people there who would give a hundred thousand dollars just to have a grandfather\u2014and much more than that for a family Ghost.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cI don\u2019t think I\u2019d like America.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cI suppose it\u2019s because we have no ruins and no curiosities,\u201d Virginia said, with a sharp edge.\\n\\n\u201cNo ruins! No curiosities!\u201d the Ghost answered. \u201cYou have your navy and your manners.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cGood evening. I\u2019ll go ask papa to give the twins an extra week\u2019s holiday.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cPlease don\u2019t go, Miss Virginia,\u201d he cried. \u201cI\u2019m so lonely and so unhappy, and I really don\u2019t know what to do. I want to go to sleep, and I can\u2019t.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThat\u2019s quite absurd! You just have to go to bed and blow out the candle.\u201d\"}"
