they shall recover.\u201d Then the king pressed and stroked the ulcers while the reading went on; at last, the patient was approved, received his nickel\u2014the king himself hanging it around his neck\u2014and was dismissed. Would you think it cured? It certainly did. Any kind of ritual will work if the patient\u2019s faith is firm. Up by Astolat there was a chapel where the Virgin had once appeared to a girl who used to herd geese there\u2014so the girl said\u2014and they built the chapel on that spot and put up a picture showing the event; a picture you\u2019d imagine would be risky for a sick person to get near. Yet, on the contrary, thousands of the lame and sick came each year, prayed before it, and left whole and sound; and even the healthy could look at it and live.\"}"
