          "text": "{\"request_id\":\"07dcb8e103ed8a9bd32769d5\",\"rewritten_text\":\"\u201cWell, Jup,\u201d I asked, \u201cwhat\u2019s the trouble now?\u2014how\u2019s your master?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, to tell the truth, massa, him not so very well as he might be.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNot well! I\u2019m truly sorry to hear it. What\u2019s he complaining of?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cDar! dat\u2019s it!\u2014he never \u2019plain of nothin\u2019\u2014but him berry sick for all dat.\u201d\\n\\n\u201c_Very_ sick, Jupiter! Why didn\u2019t you say so right away? Is he laid up in bed?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNo, dat he ain\u2019t!\u2014he ain\u2019t \u2019found nowhere\u2014dat\u2019s just where de shoe pinches; my mind is got to be berry heavy \u2019bout poor Massa Will.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cJupiter, I\u2019d like to understand what you mean. You say your master is sick. Hasn\u2019t he told you what\u2019s wrong?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, massa, \u2019tain\u2019t worth while to get mad about de matter\u2014Massa Will says noffin at all is de matter wid him; but then why should he go about looking dis here way, wid he head down and he soldiers up, and as white as a gose? And den he keeps a syphon all de time\u2014\u201d\\n\\n\u201cKeeps a what, Jupiter?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cKeeps a syphon wid de figgurs on de slate\u2014de queerest figgurs I ebber did see. Ise gittin\u2019 to be skeered, I tell you. I got to keep mighty tight eye \u2019pon him \u2019noovers. Todder day he give me slip \u2019fore de sun up and was gone de whole ob de blessed day. I had a big stick ready cut to give him deuced good beating when he did come\u2014but Ise sich a fool dat I hadn\u2019t de heart arter all\u2014he look so berry poorly.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cEh?\u2014what?\u2014ah yes!\u2014all things considered, I think you\u2019d better not be too hard on the poor fellow. Don\u2019t flog him, Jupiter\u2014he can\u2019t stand it very well; but can you make out what\u2019s brought on this illness, or rather this change in his behavior? Has anything unpleasant happened since I saw you?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNo, massa, dey ain\u2019t bin noffin unpleasant _since_ den\u2014\u2019twas _\u2019fore_ den I\u2019m feared\u2014\u2019twas de berry day you was dare.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cHow? What do you mean?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, massa, I mean de bug\u2014dare now.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThe what?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cDe bug. I\u2019m berry sartain Massa Will bin bit somewhere \u2019bout de head by dat goole-bug.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cAnd what makes you think that, Jupiter?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cClaws enuff, massa, and mouff too. I never did see sick a deuced bug\u2014he kick and he bite ebery ting what come near him. Massa Will caught him fuss, but had for to let him go \u2019gin mighty quick, I tell you\u2014den was de time he must ha\u2019 got de bite. I didn\u2019t like de look oh de bug mouff, myself, no how, so I wouldn\u2019t take hold ob him wid my finger, but I caught him wid a piece ob paper dat I found.\u201d}\"}"
