ost artistic tastes, but that you were a man no pure-minded girl should be allowed to know, and no chaste woman should ever sit in the same room with. I reminded him that I was your friend and asked him what he meant. He told me. He said it plainly, right in front of everyone. It was horrible! Why is your friendship so deadly to young men? There was that wretched boy in the Guards who committed suicide. You were his great friend. There was Sir Henry Ashton, who had to leave England with a tarnished name.\"}"
