e connect those remarks with Provis. Still, I was perfectly certain and safe that Provis had not been there.\\n\\n\u201cI dare say you\u2019re wondering at me, Mr. Pip; indeed, I see you are. But it is so very strange! You\u2019ll hardly credit what I\u2019m about to tell you. I could scarcely have believed it myself, if you had told me.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cIndeed?\u201d said I.\\n\\n\u201cNo, indeed. Mr. Pip, you remember, in the old days, a certain Christmas Day, when you were still a child, and I dined at Gargery\u2019s, and some soldiers came to the door to have a pair of handcuffs mended?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cI remember it very well.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cAnd you remember that there was a chase after two convicts, and that we joined in it, and that Gargery carried you on his back, and that I led the way, and you kept up with me as well as you could?\u201d\"}"
