is nickel\u2014the king himself hanging it around his neck\u2014and was dismissed. Would you think that would cure? It certainly did. Any kind of ritual will cure if the patient\u2019s faith is strong. Up by Astolat there was a chapel where the Virgin had once appeared to a girl who used to herd geese around there\u2014the girl said so herself\u2014and they built the chapel on that spot and hung a picture in it showing the occurrence\u2014a picture you\u2019d think would be dangerous for a sick person to approach. Yet, on the contrary, thousands of the lame and the sick came and prayed before it every year and went away whole and sound; and even the well could look at it and live.\"}"
