 grave. After they had stood there for some time, they wandered into the ruined chancel of the old abbey. There the Duchess sat down on a fallen pillar, while her husband lay at her feet smoking a cigarette and looking up at her beautiful eyes. Suddenly he tossed his cigarette aside, took her hand, and said, \u201cVirginia, a wife should have no secrets from her husband.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cDear Cecil! I have no secrets from you.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cYes, you do,\u201d he replied, smiling. \u201cYou\u2019ve never told me what happened to you when you were locked up with the ghost.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cI have never told anyone, Cecil,\u201d said Virginia gravely.\"}"
