master saw he\u2019d been taken in, and he was the sickest ring-master you ever saw, I reckon. Why, it was one of his own men! He\u2019d cooked up that whole bit from his own head and never let on to anybody. I\u2019ll admit I felt pretty sheepish for getting fooled, but I wouldn\u2019t have wanted to be in that ring-master\u2019s place\u2014not for a thousand dollars. I don\u2019t know; maybe there are bigger circuses than that one, but I haven\u2019t run into them yet. Anyways, it was good enough for me, and wherever I come across it again, it can have all of my custom every time.\"}"
