sn\u2019t opened right away; then one of my two conductors, as soon as the man appeared, struck him across the face with his heavy riding glove.\\n\\n\u201cThere was nothing in that act to single it out for my attention, since I had seen common people struck more often than dogs. Still, the other of the two, being just as provoked, struck the man in the same way with his arm. Their look and bearing were so closely alike that it was then, for the first time, that I realized they were twin brothers.\\n\\n\u201cFrom the moment we stepped out at the outer gate\u2014which we found locked, and which one of the brothers had opened to let us in and then relocked\u2014I had heard cries coming from an upper room.\u201d\"}"
