ed about it for a while and searched everywhere. Then the duke said:\\n\\n\u201cWell, he was a pretty sick man, and he probably made a mistake. That\u2019s what I think. The best thing is to let it go and keep quiet about it. We can spare it.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cOh, sure, we can spare it. I don\u2019t care about that. It\u2019s the counting I\u2019m thinking about. We want to be real square and honest and above-board here. We want to carry this money upstairs and count it in front of everybody, so nothing looks suspicious. But when the dead man says there\u2019s six thousand dollars, you know, we don\u2019t want to\u2014\u201d\"}"
