e hiding somewhere behind. I told her I was an officer in disguise, and that my partner was by the door with one of the murderers in charge. I asked her to go tell him he didn\u2019t need to wait, but should go at once to the far end of the back alley, so she could be ready to head him off when I dragged him out.\\n\\nShe was eager to see one of those already famous murderers, and she set off on the errand immediately.\"}"
