seemed to have been busy arranging some papers in the iron chest already mentioned, which had been wheeled into the middle of the room. It was open, and its contents lay beside it on the floor. The victims must have been sitting with their backs toward the window; and, from the time that passed between the beast\u2019s entry and the screams, it seems likely it wasn\u2019t noticed right away. The shutter slamming shut would naturally have been blamed on the wind.\\n\\nAs the sailor looked in, the gigantic animal had seized Madame L\u2019Espanaye by the hair\u2014loose, since she had been combing it\u2014and was brandishing the razor near her face, mimicking the motions of a barber.\"}"
