en away at once. So the forester does not know him.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThen is this Unknown the only person who saw the stag killed?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cMarry, no man saw the killing. But this Unknown saw that hardy fellow near where the stag lay, and came with loyal zeal to betray him to the forester.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cSo the Unknown was near the dead stag too? Isn\u2019t it possible he killed it himself? His loyal zeal\u2014while wearing a mask\u2014looks a little suspicious. But what does Your Highness plan to gain by racking the prisoner?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cHe will not confess, else; and then his soul would be lost. By law, his life is forfeit for his crime, and I will see that he pays it. But it would be dangerous to my own soul to let him die without confession and without absolution.\u201d\"}"
