ortune was about to happen. I can\u2019t really say why. Maybe it was more a wish than a real belief. But do you know that Jupiter\u2019s silly words about the bug being made of solid gold had a strange effect on my imagination? And then there were all the accidents and coincidences. They were so unusual. Don\u2019t you see how it was just chance that these events happened on the only day of the year that is cool enough for a fire, and that without the fire\u2014or without the dog showing up at exactly the right moment\u2014I would never have noticed the death\u2019s-head, and so I would never have become the owner of the treasure?\u201d\"}"
